      "comment": "second line of a circular move (\"    :  P[2] 500mm/sec FINE ;\"), or an instruction written without its number in the editor's numberless / scaffold style (\"    :  R[1]=1\") - the body is coloured as an instruction either way, and the leading ':' is themed like the numbered line's ':'",
      "begin": "^(\\s*)(:)",
